name: Prepared model input survives refusal and process interruption
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/prepared_input_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/approval-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW ALLOWANCE | allowance
expect: Total provider calls: 3
expect: Protected review calls: 1
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Allowance approved | approved
paste-file: @ART/failure-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 35 failed | failed-request
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/prepared_input_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART failed
paste-file: @ART/failed-replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REPLAY · Summary | failed-result
expect: Tab inputs
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 25 REPLAY · Inputs | failed-inputs
expect: Retained before runtime invocation
expect: Provider delivery is not established
resize: 160x48
live-snap: retained-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: retained-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: retained-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: retained-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: retained-40x12
keys: NPage NPage
live-snap: retained-reading-40x12
keys: End
live-snap: retained-tail-40x12
expect: Safe terminal display
ask: Does the failed request retain readable historical input across all six sizes without implying provider delivery, completed discovery or a free retry?
resize: 120x36
submit: logs
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/prepared_input_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART pause
paste-file: @ART/interruption-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/prepared_input_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART crash
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/interruption-replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 REPLAY · Summary | recovered-result
expect: interrupted
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/prepared_input_recovery.py @TMP_TARGET @ART recovered
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 25 REPLAY · Inputs | recovered-inputs
expect: Provider delivery is not established
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 Safe terminal display | recovered-tail
resize: 40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 Safe terminal display | recovered-tail-40x12
ask: Does restart retain the interrupted request's exact input and unknown consumption without inventing findings or spending protected Review capacity?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
